# Build context for demo-web/Dockerfile. Everything the image does not need, plus everything it
# must never contain: `secrets.properties` is read at runtime from the environment on Cloud Run,
# and a copy baked into a layer stays readable in the registry after it is deleted from the tree.
secrets.properties
**/secrets.properties

